[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0002","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0002.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"某主流操作系统内核网络模块栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CNNVD-2026-10099003 为某主流操作系统内核网络模块中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于未对用户态传入的数据长度进行有效校验，攻击者可通过构造特制网络请求包触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响多个版本的操作系统及衍生发行版，攻击复杂度低且无需用户交互，CVSS 评分高达 9.8，危害等级为严重。目前厂商已发布安全更新修复该漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CNNVD-2026-10099003"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-05T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-05T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议用户立即将操作系统内核升级至厂商发布的最新稳定版本，包含针对该漏洞的安全补丁。对于无法立即升级内核的系统，可采取临时缓解措施：在网络边界防火墙配置访问控制策略，限制对受影响网络服务的非授权访问；启用内核栈保护机制（如Stack Canary、ASLR）；在支持的应用场景下使用eBPF或内核模块动态拦截异常网络请求包。请关注厂商官方安全公告获取详细补丁编号及升级指引。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T07:55:39Z","references":["https://www.cnnvd.org.cn/home/vulnerability/detail/CNNVD-2026-10099003"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0094","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53359","title":"Linux Linux Kernel KVM 虚拟机逃逸漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 KVM 虚拟化子系统的 x86 影子分页机制存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，漏洞源于角色（role）字段校验缺失导致非叶子页表被错误复用。攻击者可通过在虚拟机外部修改 PDE 映射后删除内存槽（memslot）触发该漏洞，造成影子页释放后 rmap 条目仍残留，后续脏页记录或 MMU 通知器遍历该 GFN 时将解引用已释放内存导致内核崩溃或潜在权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 KVM 相关版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53359"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-04T12:17:01Z","updated":"2026-07-18T08:16:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下修复版本：主线 ≥ 7.2-rc1，或长期支持分支升级至 6.1.177+、6.6.144+、6.12.95+、6.18.38+、7.1.3+。内核修复提交包括 1ae7d5a6db6c、2ad3afa40ac6、5e470998a23e4、81ccda30b4e8、9291654d69e0、b1337aae5e19（均在 arch/x86/kvm/mmu/mmu.c 中修复影子页表角色校验缺失导致的 use-after-free）。若无法立即更新，可临时限制 /dev/kvm 设备文件的访问权限（仅允许受信用户），或卸载 kvm_amd/kvm_intel 内核模块停止虚拟机服务作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1ae7d5a6db6c190ce183e3098ca0e0846e14d462","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2ad3afa40ac6aa340dada122f9abfa46c0a6eb35","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5e470998a23e4c3d89ed24e8172cb22747e61efa","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/81ccda30b4e83d8f5cc4fd50503c44e3a33abfeb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9291654d69e08542de37755cebe4d5b02c3170d1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b1337aae5e194324e4810d561764e7793f8b3864","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/07/06/7","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2026/CVE-2026-53359.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-53359.json","https://github.com/yandex-cloud/docs/blob/f2deb42e097c742df149ae3be26d835122873712/ru/_includes/security/security-bulletins/CVE-2026-53359-januscape.md","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/ARGOeu-Metrics/secmon-probes/blob/39c7b00a6c5ee3198df75d8d1d85ccdfdb0f728e/src/WN-probes/check_CVE-2026-53359","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0ebf8eac5e6d2af2400b71f0ba35608811c9cff6/references/CVE-2026-53359-2026-07-06-1805","https://github.com/Unclecheng-li/poc-lab/blob/b3a8fa7275a8368823f63eba88eb6e6b8e62a718/CVE-2026-53359%20Januscape/exploit/BUILD.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/7ddd42377be9a6b7218518cc45c52da044b527c3/2026/CVE-2026-53359.json","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-53359/KVM-XJ.c","https://github.com/QVMConsole/QVMConsole/blob/ab919948bd90c04a4cc8bc0173e0b3b07ae450df/security/cve-2026-53359/restore.sh","https://github.com/Aoripus-LTD/Januscape-Hotfix","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-53359","https://github.com/chuzhongyun/CVE-2026-53359-Kernel-Fix","https://github.com/xj2268-TA/KVM-Januscape","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-53359","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-53359"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0094.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0094.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0094.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0007","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0007.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"CNNVD 暂未公开详情的未知厂商安全漏洞","description":"CNNVD-2026-10507485 为中国国家信息安全漏洞库收录的2026年安全漏洞，目前该漏洞详情尚未公开发布。CNNVD 已收录该漏洞编号，但具体受影响厂商、产品类型、攻击向量及影响范围等信息需等待 CNNVD 官方进一步披露。建议持续关注 CNNVD 官网更新。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CNNVD-2026-10507485"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-04T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议持续关注 CNNVD 官网该漏洞详情页面，待详细信息发布后，依据官方公告中的修复方案及时更新对应软件版本或应用补丁。同时加强网络安全监测，及时发现可疑攻击行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cnnvd.org.cn/home/loophole/detail?id=CNNVD-2026-10507485"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0664","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0664.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-58426","title":"Gitea Actions 制品库 V4 签名 URL HMAC 模糊性安全漏洞","description":"Gitea Actions Artifacts V4 版本的签名 URL 存在 HMAC 签名模糊性漏洞，根因是签名计算时将 endpoint、expires、artifactName、taskID、artifactID 等字段直接拼接而未使用分隔符或长度前缀，导致不同参数元组可产生相同的 HMAC 输入。攻击者只需拥有运行 Gitea Actions 任务的权限，即可获取自身任务的合法签名 URL，通过重写 artifactName、taskID、artifactID 参数（利用数字边界模糊性构造相同的 HMAC 输入串），在保持原 HMAC 签名不变的情况下，将请求上下文重定向到另一个正在运行的任务（甚至跨私有仓库）。漏洞包含两条利用路径：DownloadArtifact 实现跨任务/跨仓库工件读取（机密性高影响），UploadArtifact 实现跨任务工件暂存区写入攻击者控制数据并篡改目标工件元数据（完整性高影响）。影响范围覆盖启用 Actions 且使用 V4 工件签名 URL 的 Gitea 实例，经测试 main 分支及 v1.22.6 至 v1.26.1 版本均受影响（v1.21.11 无 V4 路由不受影响）。攻击条件为：攻击者可运行 Actions 任务、目标任务处于 running 状态、目标任务 ID 与工件名可知或可预测、伪造的 artifactID 需能解析为 int64。CVSS 3.1 评分 9.6 (CRITICAL)，向量 CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:N，CWE-347。Gitea 官方已在 v1.26.2 等版本修复，建议升级并采用结构化签名载荷（如 JSON/长度前缀）修复根因。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-58426","GHSA-hg5r-vq93-9fv6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-06T18:17:26Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Gitea 至 1.26.2 或更高版本（修复版本见 https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.2），或通过 Gitea 官方安全公告 GHSA-hg5r-vq93-9fv6 获取补丁。如无法立即升级，可在管理后台禁用 Actions 功能（设置 → Actions → 禁用），或在应用层限制 Actions 任务权限、限制私有仓库 Actions 运行权限，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.2/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/37707","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.2","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-hg5r-vq93-9fv6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58426.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/617f5713eaf60aa312a8e3fe5c9942eeb7cf98ee/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58426.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-58426.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-58426.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-58426.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-58426.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-58426.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_2_CVE-2026-58426.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-584xx/CVE-2026-58426.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-58426.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0664.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0662","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0662.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-58424","title":"Gitea Actions 分叉 PR 工作流审批门绕过漏洞","description":"Gitea Actions 的分叉 Pull Request 工作流程审批门存在永久绕过漏洞。`ifNeedApproval()` 函数在判断是否需要审批时，仅检查触发用户在该仓库中是否有任意历史审批记录，而未限定 Pull Request、提交 SHA 或时间窗口。攻击者只需让维护者一次性批准其首个分叉 PR 的无害工作流，即可永久获得该仓库的 CI 执行权限，此后提交的任何恶意工作流均无需再次审批即可在 Runner 上任意执行代码。该漏洞影响所有 Gitea v1.20.0 及之后版本（含 main 分支最新提交），CVSS 评分 8.9（高危）。攻击条件为：攻击者需拥有可分叉目标仓库的已认证账户，且目标仓库已启用 Actions 并运行了 Actions Runner。修复方案尚未发布。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-58424","GHSA-777r-4v59-6486"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-06T18:18:46Z","remediation":"升级到 Gitea v1.26.4 或更高版本以彻底修复此漏洞。如暂无法升级，可在 app.ini 中设置 [actions] ENABLED = false 禁用 Actions 功能，或通过仓库设置拒绝所有 fork pull request，并移除已注册的外部运行器。对于已存在外部 PR 历史的仓库，建议撤销所有外部贡献者的 Actions 执行权限并重新审核其历史 PR。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38010","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.4","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-777r-4v59-6486","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58424.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/617f5713eaf60aa312a8e3fe5c9942eeb7cf98ee/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58424.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-58424.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-58424.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-58424.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-58424.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-58424.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-584xx/CVE-2026-58424.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-58424.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_2_CVE-2026-58424.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0662.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0661","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0661.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-58423","title":"Gitea LFS SSH 子动词认证绕过导致私有仓库未授权读取漏洞","description":"Gitea 的 SSH LFS 子动词处理存在身份验证绕过漏洞。在 `cmd/serv.go` 的 `getAccessMode` 函数中，当 LFS 子动词既非 `upload` 也非 `download` 时，生产模式下 `PanicInDevOrTesting` 仅记录错误而不触发 panic，返回 `AccessModeNone`（值为 0）。后续权限检查 `userMode < mode` 恒为 false（因 `userMode` 非负），导致私有仓库的权限校验被完全绕过。同时 HTTP LFS 端对下载操作的 `Op` 字段不做校验，攻击者可利用此令牌读取任意私有仓库的所有 LFS 对象。任何拥有 SSH 访问权限的 Gitea 注册用户均可利用此漏洞，通过发送格式错误的 LFS 子动词（如 `badverb`）获取有效 LFS JWT 令牌，从而越权下载实例中所有私有仓库的 LFS 文件，造成严重敏感数据泄露。该漏洞影响 Gitea 默认配置（启用 SSH 和 LFS）的生产环境部署。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-58423","GHSA-7wvc-rvp7-w99x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-06T18:18:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 Gitea 至 v1.26.4 或更高版本（该版本已通过 PR #38008 修复 LFS 子动词验证缺陷）。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 SSH LFS 功能（在 app.ini 中设置 `[server] DISABLE_SSH = true`）或限制用户注册以防止未授权用户获得 SSH 访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38008","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.4","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-7wvc-rvp7-w99x","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58423.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/617f5713eaf60aa312a8e3fe5c9942eeb7cf98ee/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58423.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-58423.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-58423.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-58423.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-58423.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-58423.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-584xx/CVE-2026-58423.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-58423.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_2_CVE-2026-58423.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0661.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0660","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0660.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-58422","title":"Gitea OAuth 登录回调授权不当漏洞","description":"Gitea 1.26.1 版本中 OAuth2 登录回调接口存在授权不当漏洞。当用户通过已关联的外部身份提供商（如 GitHub、GitLab、Keycloak 等）进行 OAuth 认证时，回调处理函数 `handleOAuth2SignIn` 会无条件将本地账户的 `IsActive` 标志重置为 `true`，并立即签发有效会话。这导致管理员通过\"禁用账户\"功能对用户实施的停用操作被静默撤销，被禁用的用户只需完成一次 OAuth 登录即可自动恢复账户活跃状态，重新获得仓库、组织及访问令牌的全部读写权限。攻击条件为攻击者已关联外部 IdP 且管理员曾执行过禁用操作，无需任何额外认证即可绕过管理员权限控制。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-58422","GHSA-g9g6-qhrc-p3qc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-06T18:18:46Z","remediation":"立即将 Gitea 升级至 v1.26.4 或更高版本（该版本已通过 PR #38009 修复 OAuth 回调中自动重新激活已禁用用户的问题）。如无法立即升级，可暂时解除受影响用户的 OAuth 外部身份提供商关联，改为仅使用本地密码登录，并在 IdP 侧撤销该用户的联邦身份授权作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38009","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.4","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-g9g6-qhrc-p3qc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58422.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58422.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-58422.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-58422.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-58422.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-58422.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-58422.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-584xx/CVE-2026-58422.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-58422.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3069a5a48fe58a340f9d7c1784827618071ec84e/content/posts/cve-2026-58422.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0660.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0659","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0659.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-58421","title":"Gitea Gitea CODEOWNERS 正则表达式拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Gitea 的 CODEOWNERS 功能使用 regexp2 库匹配文件路径与所有权规则，但用户提供的正则表达式模式未经任何过滤或超时限制直接传入 regexp2.Compile 编译。攻击者只需注册一个普通账号，在仓库默认分支中写入包含灾难性回溯模式（如 (a+)+）的 CODEOWNERS 文件，再创建一个包含长重复字符后接不匹配字符的文件名的拉取请求分支，即可触发正则引擎指数级回溯。Gitea 在处理拉取请求时会在数据库事务中逐条评估 CODEOWNERS 规则且无超时，11 条规则即可导致单次请求耗时超过 30 秒，多个并行请求可耗尽数据库连接池，使整个 Gitea 实例对所有用户不可用。该漏洞影响所有 Gitea 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，已在 v1.26.4 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-58421","GHSA-v96j-25gv-g2w9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-06T18:18:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 Gitea 至 v1.26.4 或更高版本，该版本已为 regexp2 编译设置匹配超时时间，防止正则表达式灾难性回溯导致拒绝服务。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制单个用户创建 PR 的速率，并监控数据库连接池使用情况。同时建议在 CODEOWNERS 文件中限制规则数量，避免大量规则被恶意利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38011","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.4","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-v96j-25gv-g2w9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58421.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58421.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-58421.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-58421.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-58421.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-58421.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-58421.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-584xx/CVE-2026-58421.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-58421.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3069a5a48fe58a340f9d7c1784827618071ec84e/content/posts/cve-2026-58421.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0659.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0657","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0657.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-58419","title":"Gitea 通知 API 访问撤销后泄露私有问题元数据漏洞","description":"Gitea 通知 API 存在信息泄露漏洞，当用户对私有仓库的访问权限被撤销后，虽然通知响应中的 `repository` 字段被正确置空，但 `subject` 字段仍会泄露私有 Issue 或 Pull Request 的标题、状态、API 及 HTML 链接、最新评论 URL 等敏感元数据。攻击者只需在拥有访问权限时接收过通知，即可在权限撤销后通过 `GET /api/v1/notifications` 和 `GET /api/v1/notifications/threads/{id}` 接口持续监控私有仓库的活动动态。该漏洞影响 Gitea v1.26.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，已在 v1.26.4 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-58419","GHSA-44qc-pgvp-wx7v"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-06T18:18:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 Gitea 至 v1.26.4 或以上版本（该版本修复了通知 API 在访问撤销后泄露私有 issue 元数据的问题）。如无法立即升级，可临时在反向代理层对 `/api/v1/notifications` 和 `/api/v1/notifications/threads/` 端点添加访问审计日志，监控异常通知读取行为，并尽快安排升级窗口完成版本更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38108","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.4","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-44qc-pgvp-wx7v","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58419.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58419.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-58419.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-58419.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-58419.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-58419.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-58419.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-584xx/CVE-2026-58419.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-58419.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3069a5a48fe58a340f9d7c1784827618071ec84e/content/posts/cve-2026-58419.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0657.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0657.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0656","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0656.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-58418","title":"Gitea Gitea 仓库迁移HTTP重定向服务器端请求伪造漏洞","description":"Gitea 仓库迁移功能存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。Gitea 1.25.4 在仓库迁移接口（POST /api/v1/repos/migrate）中正确验证了初始 URL，阻止了指向 127.0.0.1 等内网地址的请求。然而，当初始 URL 指向攻击者控制的服务器并返回 HTTP 302 重定向到内网地址时，Gitea 会跟随重定向而不进行二次验证。拥有普通用户权限的攻击者可利用此漏洞，以 Gitea 服务器为代理访问仅限本地或内网访问的服务，包括内部 Git 仓库、云元数据端点（169.254.169.254）、内部 API 及数据库等，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.25.4 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-58418","GHSA-rqhx-647v-wx32"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-06T18:18:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 Gitea 至 v1.26.4 或更高版本，该版本已合入 PR #38108 的修复，在跟随 HTTP 重定向时重新校验目标地址是否属于内网/回环地址。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层配置规则，阻止 Gitea 服务器对外发起指向内网地址的 HTTP 请求，或临时禁用仓库迁移功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38108","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.4","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-rqhx-647v-wx32","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58418.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58418.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-58418.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-58418.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-58418.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-58418.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-584xx/CVE-2026-58418.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-58418.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3069a5a48fe58a340f9d7c1784827618071ec84e/content/posts/cve-2026-58418.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/c49cc435e5b650d791479d644cf6936ab9b905ca/api/2026/CVE-2026-58418.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0656.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0656.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0656.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0300","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-27771","title":"Gitea Composer 包源链接权限检查不足漏洞","description":"Gitea 是一款自托管的 Git 服务，其 Composer 包源链接存在权限检查不足的漏洞（CWE-862 缺失授权）。已认证的攻击者可利用此缺陷，通过构造特定请求访问本应受限的私有或内部包源链接，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.1 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。建议用户升级至 1.26.2 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-27771","GHSA-8qw8-rq86-9pc2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:59Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:37Z","remediation":"立即将 Gitea 升级至 v1.26.2 或更高版本（最新稳定版 v1.27.0），该版本已修复 Composer 包源链接的权限检查缺失问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制对 /api/packages/*/composer 路径的访问，仅允许授权用户访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.2/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/37610","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.2","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-8qw8-rq86-9pc2","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-27771.yaml","https://github.com/portbuster1337/CVE-2026-27771","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2026/CVE-2026-27771.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-27771.yaml","https://github.com/SourByte05/Vulnerability-Wiki-PoC/blob/e52a2c3eaf2fb0befc721cf0919d07ea435a23b4/2026/06/Gitea-CVE-2026-27771-%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87/Gitea-CVE-2026-27771-%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/4e96ec5c1f919e7ddf89ce2335ced09b058e2b49/2026.05/CVE-2026-27771%EF%BC%9AGitea%20%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-27771.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27771.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/c911d60f6d680a69991ad0dd5e13c4da403965fe/plugins/gitea/gitea/CVE-2026-27771.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_2_CVE-2026-27771.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-27771.yml","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/9cd45c8ff86fc94d27c6255a665548fbf0c1c23f/2026/CVE-2026-27771/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-27771"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0300.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0258","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0258.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-28740","title":"Gitea Git LFS 对象重用授权绕过漏洞","description":"Gitea 在 Git LFS 对象复用功能中存在授权绕过漏洞（CWE-639）。由于源代码对象授权检查仅依赖仓库级别的访问权限，而未要求对拥有 LFS 对象的源仓库具有 Code 单元访问权限，导致拥有一个仓库 Code 写入权限的攻击者可将私有源仓库中的 Git LFS 对象关联到目标仓库，从而越权访问本无权限的私有源代码对象。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。建议升级至 1.26.3 或更高版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-28740","GHSA-2m9v-5q2g-58vq"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:59Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:38Z","remediation":"修复说明：Gitea ≤1.26.2 中跨仓库 LFS 对象复用时仅检查仓库级别的访问权限而未验证 Code 单元权限，导致无 Code 访问权限的用户可借用 LFS 对象获取私有源仓库内容。官方在 v1.26.3 中通过 PR #38050 修复，但 v1.26.3 存在页面加载回归问题，请直接升级到 v1.26.4（2026-06-21 发布）；从 https://dl.gitea.com/gitea/1.26.4/ 下载对应平台的二进制替换后重启服务。如无法立即升级，可在仓库设置中移除非必要用户的仓库访问权限，并严格审查所有对私有仓库有读取权限的用户的 Code 单元授权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38050","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-2m9v-5q2g-58vq","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-28740.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28740.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_2_CVE-2026-28740.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/gitea.dev/CVE-2026-28740.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2167857fddab84dfe24129edd6c6319301254e21/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28740.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-28740.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-28740.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/0d037049524b95a60ac45ee73f1d3c40caf9c2d9/posts/cve-2026-28740-go-gitea-dev.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-2m9v-5q2g-58vq/GHSA-2m9v-5q2g-58vq.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-28740.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0258.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0255","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0255.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-27775","title":"Gitea 预接收钩子权限缓存检查绕过漏洞","description":"Gitea 1.25.5 版本在预接收钩子（pre-receive hook）会话中存在权限缓存缺陷，其对单分支的写入权限检查结果会错误地在同一会话中的多个引用（refs）间复用。拥有某分支维护者编辑权限的用户可借此跨分支提权，从而获得对完整存储库的写入访问权限。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高，影响所有使用分支级权限功能且版本低于 1.25.6 的 Gitea 实例。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-27775","GHSA-649p-mmhf-85c7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:59Z","updated":"2026-07-06T18:17:26Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Gitea 1.26.3 或更高版本（最新为 1.26.4），该版本通过修复预接收挂钩（pre-receive hook）中分支级写入权限的缓存逻辑，阻止跨 ref 复用权限从而提权至完整仓库写入。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用预接收挂钩或对敏感仓库限制可写入分支的用户范围为最小必要权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38151","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-649p-mmhf-85c7","https://github.com/Lazarus-AI/clearwing/blob/e8ca31740f4189d1cf18eee9155db840f4cb2f7b/evaluations/cve-2026-27775.sh","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27775.json","https://github.com/patrickmgarrity/Anthropic-Credited-CVEs/blob/197a0f190193760dbcf80800bcce685aa017dec5/cves/CVE-2026-27775.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27775.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-27775.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-27775.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-27775.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/34612da2888772c9dd8862e0da8f78db038b1965/cve/CVE-2026-27775.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-649p-mmhf-85c7/GHSA-649p-mmhf-85c7.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-27775.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0255.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0255.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0255.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0254","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0254.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-27761","title":"Gitea 仓库 RSS/Atom Feed 接口访问令牌作用域绕过漏洞","description":"Gitea 个人访问令牌（PAT）在仓库 RSS/Atom Feed 端点存在权限范围绕过漏洞。当用户使用受限作用域（如 `read:issue`）的令牌访问 RSS/Atom Feed 接口时，可以读取该用户有权访问的任意私有仓库的提交记录，包括提交 SHA、完整提交信息（可能包含密钥等敏感内容）以及提交者姓名和邮箱。而在 `/raw`、`/media`、`/archive` 及内容 API 等端点，相同令牌会被正确拒绝（403）。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。攻击者只需持有任意受限作用域的有效令牌即可利用，无需特殊权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-27761","GHSA-3pww-vcvm-3gmj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:58Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:37Z","remediation":"立即将 Gitea 升级至 v1.26.3 或更高版本（官方强烈建议直接升级至 v1.26.4），该版本在 RSS/Atom feed 端点强制实施了 API 令牌作用域检查。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 RSS/Atom feed 功能，或在反向代理层对 `/api/v1/repos/*/feed` 路径添加访问控制，仅允许拥有 repository 作用域的令牌访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38147","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-3pww-vcvm-3gmj","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27761.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-27761.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27761.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-27761.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-27761.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-3pww-vcvm-3gmj/GHSA-3pww-vcvm-3gmj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-27761.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-27761.json","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2026/FreeBSD-2026-0293.md","https://github.com/peleduri/zero-day-pulse/blob/d56f83f6d1e3899004c32c7c15cdd38e9dd954ba/docs/index.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0254.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0254.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0254.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0251","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0251.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-25038","title":"Gitea Gitea 私人组织标签未授权访问漏洞","description":"Gitea 1.26.2 版本中存在组织标签访问控制缺陷漏洞，由于未正确对私有组织的标签读取端点实施可见性限制，导致未经授权的用户可通过 Organization Labels API 获取私有组织的标签元数据，造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞获取本应仅限组织成员访问的标签信息，但无法对标签进行修改操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-25038","GHSA-v73x-hx65-6pf4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:36Z","remediation":"立即将 Gitea 升级至 v1.26.4 或更高版本（官方强烈建议跳过 v1.26.3 直接升级到 v1.26.4，因 v1.26.3 存在仓库代码页加载回归问题）。该漏洞已在 PR #38151 中修复，升级后系统会在组织标签读取端点强制校验组织可见性，非成员用户无法再通过 Organization Labels API 获取私有组织标签数据。如无法立即升级，可暂时移除非成员对 Organization Labels API 的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38151","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-v73x-hx65-6pf4","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-25038.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e